      "judgment_rationale": "Unified Runtimes combines tenant-scoped Cloud pool status and instances with tenant-scoped project sandboxes in one tenant route. The pool router now enforces authentication, global administration, tenant scoping, cross-tenant 404 behavior and lifecycle conflicts. Tenant scope intentionally withholds global capacity, so the Web resource cards remain degraded until they render the structured unavailable reason instead of zero values. Desktop currently exposes connection settings and runtime telemetry fragments, not this routed inventory; a single-machine sidecar projection remains meaningful and is planned."
